+The numerical supplement is distributed with the manuscript source as \path{analysis/reproduce.py}. Its inputs and precision conventions are declared in the script. Machine-readable results in the same \path{analysis/} directory comprise \path{nominal_scales.json} for nominal calculations, \path{confinement_family.csv} for the confinement sweep, and \path{analytic_checks.json} for the test report. All three are regenerated by the command given in Appendix~\ref{app:numeric}; no experimental image dataset, third-party Python package, or external repository access is required.
 
